; Late-Imperial spending priority is a per-pass policy flag.
; 1 = a siege/blacksmith/army upgrade should consume the excess bank before
; extra non-siege unit production is re-armed. The flag is recomputed every pass
; so it cannot become stale after a research completes.
(defrule
    (goal byzantine-late-upgrade-priority -1)
=>
    (set-goal byzantine-late-upgrade-priority 0)
)

